      "value": "I know Virtual Market has special scripts that need allowed by VRChat devs to work in some worlds.\n\nOne of scripts is special camera overlay script used in Sky Park-Renew worlds.\n\nThe unique is it can use your handheld camera and control it. This will capture picture and post on simulated social media on phone.\n\nWhen i go around with Unity6 Beta, all works fine, but i was not able to finish 2 archievements in Sky Park. (will affect all people who use Unity6 Beta)\n\nBack in Live version, the camera overlay works. All worked and i can complete 2 archievements.\n\nThe question is only why it doesn't work:\n\n- might use special code for Unity2022, doesn't work in Untiy6.\n\n- is not yet whitelisted in Unity6\n\nMaybe not updated for Vket, but who knows. So it's reported as bug here.\n\nFirst 2 photos in Unity6. Two last are in Live.",
